WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Empty, cool, unbreakable plate. Dry hands.
Use a shallow basin and close surfaces.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Two-hand example: lift just above the rim.
Place on the adjacent dry surface.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Rest. One usable hand needs an adapted plan.
No wet, hot, full or breakable dishes.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Example replay: watch the short transfer.
Do not copy a grasp you cannot use.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Ask an OT about a grip aid or sliding.
This is not carrying across a room.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Final replay: lower, then release.
Keep your usual support and assistance.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Rest. Ask for help with difficult stages.
No need to repeat the task today.
